    <visualElement><elementName>Text</elementName><elementAttributes><entry><string>Description</string><string>P47 Interrupt controller - Digital task
The priority encoder: masking AND gates and a 5-input priority encoder from gates.
Allowed parts: And, Or, Not, NAnd, NOr, XOr, XNOr + wiring parts
Do not rename, move or delete the input and output pins.</string></entry></elementAttributes><pos x="100" y="40"/></visualElement>
